		{
			dependencies: ["503A37C31E60684B"]
			description: [
"&6&l※ A message to players of the private version"
""
"&7We’ve come to this point, please listen to what I have to say."
""
"&7The original idea for this integration package was just seeing a group of friends not knowing what to do with various private modules and KJS scripts, so I decided to make it."
"&7Unknowingly, so many versions have been updated, and many friendly suggestions and criticisms have been received."
""
"&7I know that this package is not very technical and will not satisfy everyone. The original intention of the private version has always been to \"enhance the original version\", not to be brainless. Some people may not understand: With so many private goods added, why are some private goods not added? I understand this thinking too. But I am unwilling to touch the core of an integrated package, and I dare not touch it. From the hand rubbing of ULV to the later ordering, this is an improvement in efficiency; from the initial small machine to the later giant structure, this is also an improvement in efficiency. I hope that players can enjoy the feeling of doubling the efficiency from ULV voltage to LV voltage, instead of giving the player the feeling of the entire integration package at once, leaving players without any feeling of feeling when they subsequently increase the voltage, turning them into ruthless boilerplate robots."
""
"&7I personally have not made any significant contributions to the GTL private goods ecosystem. I would like to sincerely thank you all for your continued support."
""
"&e&lFinally, I would like to sincerely thank the following guys for their modules and KJS scripts:"
"&aGregTech Leisure &7- &fGregTech Leisure Production Team"
"&aProduction Line Tearer &7- &fG Su Xiaodeng"
"&aGTL-additions                            &7- &fDragonator"
"&aGTL-EXtend &7- &fAutumn leaves"
"&aproduction line explosion &7- &fcerebellum completely undeveloped"
"&akirin &7- &fSisyphus stone"
"&aExtendedae-Plus &7- &fPressure Cooker/iava"
"&aGTMGTMAdvancedHatch     &7- &fxingmot"
"&aAE Wireless Transceiver       &7- &fxiaopiao"
"&aGray Sister’s Wonderful Auxiliary Formula &7- &fPoi-[Blank Data]"
"&aSpecial for production line twisters &7- &fOgawa"
"&aContributor &7- &fChangzui No. 1"
"&7Thank you for your creations, which make this world richer."
]
